{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Castle Falkenstein \u2013 TimeLab DLC</strong></h2><br>In 1883, King Ludwig II of Bavaria, the visionary behind the famous Neuschwanstein Castle, conceived the idea for another building: Castle Falkenstein. Although this project was never realized, we bring his vision to life in a captivating virtual reconstruction.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Detailed Planning and Background Story:</strong> Based on the concrete designs of King Ludwig II, gain deep insights into the various development phases and the intriguing history of Castle Falkenstein.<br></li><li> <strong>Explore the Bedchamber:</strong> Discover the artistic ideas and sophisticated architecture embedded in the never-implemented plans of the Bavarian king. Every detail has been meticulously reconstructed to authentically represent the majestic vision.<br></li><li> <strong>Additional Game \u201cTower of Defense\u201c:</strong> Test your skills and strategic abilities! The included game offers fun and challenges.<br>Embark on a time travel journey and experience the majestic splendor of Castle Falkenstein as envisioned by King Ludwig II. This unique experience is a must for history enthusiasts and lovers of sophisticated architecture alike.</li></ul><br><strong>Available now on Steam!</strong><br><br><strong>Please Note:</strong> This DLC is compatible with our VR platform &quot;TimeLab&quot; also available on Steam.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3047270?t=1744281508","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047270/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744281508","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047270/b6906a25ae9a240e0d97d319ad50bf628a2e3a79/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744281508","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047270/b6906a25ae9a